The files in this directory are sample programs for the 
Personal Iris, using the AGE 'Power Glove Serial Adapter'
(PGSA), aka the "black box."

They are supplied "as is," with no warranty implied.

	glove_stream.c	basic program to read glove data
	flyinghand.c	displays a wireframe graphic
	surface_flicker.c
			3D drawing program.  Has 'flicker mode'
			for use with shutter glasses (which, in 
			this case, are NOT synched by the Iris)
	
Questions etc. should go to:  gbnewby@alexia.lis.uiuc.edu
